OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for killing biker in
OL,4,Aroad crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been spared jail after he
OL,7,Fadmitted killing a motorcyclist in a
OL,8,Fcollision.
OL,10,FBrian Smith, 62, died when his bike was
OL,11,Fhit by a car driven by David Smith, 75,
OL,12,Fon Horncastle Road near Boston in April
OL,13,F2024.
OL,15,FLincoln Crown Court heard David Smith,
OL,16,Fof Horbling Lane, Stickney,
OL,17,FLincolnshire, pulled out of a junction
OL,18,Fand turned in front of the motorbike,
OL,19,Fwhich was visible to him up to nine
OL,20,Fseconds before the crash.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
