OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for killing biker in
OL,4,Aroad crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe pleaded guilty to causing death by
OL,7,Fcareless driving and was sentenced to
OL,8,F18 months imprisonment suspended for
OL,9,Ftwo years.
